{
    "title": "MeteoSwiss",
    "description": "Intuitive, personalised\r\nand innovative: the MeteoSwiss app is your comprehensive companion for all weather information in Switzerland \u2013 compact and always up to date.\r\n\r\nGet updates on weather forecasts, current measurements, and federal natural hazard warnings. Subscribe to natural hazard warnings as push notifications for your locations, and customize the warning types and thresholds according to your preferences.\r\n\r\nStay informed with informative blog posts on weather and climate topics.\r\n\r\n\r\nDetailed features:\r\n\r\nWeather Forecasts\r\n\r\n\u2022 Weather on-site with a 5-hour forecast for your location\r\n\u2022 Local forecasts for all places/ZIP codes in Switzerland with an overview for the next 8 days\r\n\u2022 Wind/temperatures at different altitudes\r\n\u2022 Weather report for the three language regions of Switzerland, as well as possible developments for the following week, European isobar map, and road condition forecast\r\n\r\n\r\nWeather Animations\r\n\r\n\u2022 Measurements and forecasts of precipitation, precipitation type, wind, temperature, hail, and clouds\r\n\u2022 Hail reporting function\r\n\u2022 Satellite images\r\n\r\n\r\nNatural Hazard Warnings\r\n\r\n\u2022 All warnings on natural hazards from the Federal Authorities (severe weather, floods, forest fire, earthquakes and avalanches)\r\n\u2022 Warning area overview on an interactive map\r\n\u2022 Federal natural hazard bulletin\r\n\u2022 Subscribeable warnings as push notifications for locations and warning types with individual warning thresholds\r\n\r\n\r\nCurrent Measurements\r\n\r\n\u2022 Overview of weather stations on an interactive map and list view\r\n\u2022 Selection of various measurement data with up to 10-minute updates\r\n\r\n\r\nYour Locations\r\n\r\n\u2022 Search for all places/ZIP codes in Switzerland\r\n\u2022 An easy overview of your locations: The app keeps an organised list of your relevant locations.\r\n\r\n\r\nMeteo Reports\r\n\r\n\u2022 Display of submitted reports and images for specific weather events from users of the MeteoSwiss app\r\n\r\n\r\nSports & Health\r\n\r\n\u2022 Air quality\r\n\u2022 Pollen forecast\r\n\u2022 UV index\r\n\u2022 Snow depth and fresh snow forecast\r\n\r\n\r\nMeteoSwiss Blog\r\n\r\n\u2022 Daily updated posts and information on weather and climate\r\n\r\n\r\nAviation Weather (available through in-app purchase)\r\n\r\n\u2022 METAR/TAF Switzerland\r\n\u2022 Aviation weather warnings Switzerland\r\n\u2022 Windanimations Switzerland on different FL\r\n\u2022 GAFOR Switzerland\r\n\u2022 Text forecasts for powered flight, gliding and ballooning\r\n\u2022 Low Level SWC Alps and Europe\r\n\u2022 Pressure difference\r\n\u2022 QNH \u2013 Chart\r\n\u2022 W / T \u2013 Chart\r\n\u2022 Wind \u2013 Barbs\r\n\u2022 Regtherm\r\n\u2022 Trajectories\r\n\u2022 Emagramms\r\n\r\n\r\nLegal basis\r\n\r\nhttps://www.meteoswiss.admin.ch/about-us/legal-basis.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Intuitive, personalised<br>and innovative: the MeteoSwiss app is your comprehensive companion for all weather information in Switzerland \u2013 compact and always up to date.<br><br>Get updates on weather forecasts, current measurements, and federal natural hazard warnings. Subscribe to natural hazard warnings as push notifications for your locations, and customize the warning types and thresholds according to your preferences.<br><br>Stay informed with informative blog posts on weather and climate topics.<br><br><br>Detailed features:<br><br>Weather Forecasts<br><br>\u2022 Weather on-site with a 5-hour forecast for your location<br>\u2022 Local forecasts for all places/ZIP codes in Switzerland with an overview for the next 8 days<br>\u2022 Wind/temperatures at different altitudes<br>\u2022 Weather report for the three language regions of Switzerland, as well as possible developments for the following week, European isobar map, and road condition forecast<br><br><br>Weather Animations<br><br>\u2022 Measurements and forecasts of precipitation, precipitation type, wind, temperature, hail, and clouds<br>\u2022 Hail reporting function<br>\u2022 Satellite images<br><br><br>Natural Hazard Warnings<br><br>\u2022 All warnings on natural hazards from the Federal Authorities (severe weather, floods, forest fire, earthquakes and avalanches)<br>\u2022 Warning area overview on an interactive map<br>\u2022 Federal natural hazard bulletin<br>\u2022 Subscribeable warnings as push notifications for locations and warning types with individual warning thresholds<br><br><br>Current Measurements<br><br>\u2022 Overview of weather stations on an interactive map and list view<br>\u2022 Selection of various measurement data with up to 10-minute updates<br><br><br>Your Locations<br><br>\u2022 Search for all places/ZIP codes in Switzerland<br>\u2022 An easy overview of your locations: The app keeps an organised list of your relevant locations.<br><br><br>Meteo Reports<br><br>\u2022 Display of submitted reports and images for specific weather events from users of the MeteoSwiss app<br><br><br>Sports &amp; Health<br><br>\u2022 Air quality<br>\u2022 Pollen forecast<br>\u2022 UV index<br>\u2022 Snow depth and fresh snow forecast<br><br><br>MeteoSwiss Blog<br><br>\u2022 Daily updated posts and information on weather and climate<br><br><br>Aviation Weather (available through in-app purchase)<br><br>\u2022 METAR/TAF Switzerland<br>\u2022 Aviation weather warnings Switzerland<br>\u2022 Windanimations Switzerland on different FL<br>\u2022 GAFOR Switzerland<br>\u2022 Text forecasts for powered flight, gliding and ballooning<br>\u2022 Low Level SWC Alps and Europe<br>\u2022 Pressure difference<br>\u2022 QNH \u2013 Chart<br>\u2022 W / T \u2013 Chart<br>\u2022 Wind \u2013 Barbs<br>\u2022 Regtherm<br>\u2022 Trajectories<br>\u2022 Emagramms<br><br><br>Legal basis<br><br>https://www.meteoswiss.admin.ch/about-us/legal-basis.html",
